{"id":"en_she-played-the-long-game","title":"She Played the Long Game","titleEn":"She Played the Long Game","description":"For three decades Sarah and James built a marriage on the understanding that they would have no children. That arrangement collapses when a young man appears at their door, claiming to be James's illegitimate son and demanding his share of the inheritance. The revelation of her husband's betrayal gives way to a second shock: Sarah discloses a secret of her own, twin children who are now twenty-five years old. What follows is a calculated counterattack, mounted with care while James and his mistress plot without realizing how much she knows. Forged paternity tests, concealed debts and a wedding that descends into violence bring every deception into the open, and no one emerges untainted.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-played-the-long-game/id_ID/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/she-played-the-long-game/id_ID/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Comeback Story","Drama","Eye-opening","Getting Back at Ex","Morals & Ethics","Comeback Story"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvomw/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_she-played-the-long-game_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvomw/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-played-the-long-game_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvomw/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_she-played-the-long-game_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cvomw/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","d